     "<div dir=\"ltr\">It&#39;s because when the app first loads, the value of the fileInput is NULL. The req function was designed to deal with this (in a nicer way than simply checking for NULL everywhere):<div><a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/req.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/req.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390324353000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SIrciDN1eOE2_Iup-M033\">https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/req.html</a><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Apr 3, 2017 at 9:59 AM Bamboo Lemur &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">victor....@wanadoo.fr</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<br><br>I have just started to learn shiny. I made an fileInput to load a dataset in the app, and I print the outputTable in a tabsetPanel. The data are loaded correctly and the table appears, but when I start the App, I&#39;ve got a error message in the tabPanel :<br><br>in French : &quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in read.table: &#39;file&#39; doit être une chîne de caractères ou une connection&quot;<br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">which could be tanslated in english by :</span> &quot;&#39;file&#39; must be a string or a connection&quot;<br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">How do I fix this ?</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>code :<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  titlePanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Gene Set Enrichment Analysis&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    fileInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choose a txt file&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multiple</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              accept </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL<br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      tabsetPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Data&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;contents&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;GO&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;GO Enrichment&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;KEGG&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;KEGG Analaysis&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Protein Domains&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Protein Domains&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br>  inFile </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL<br>  output$contents </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    inFile </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$data<br>    read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inFile$datapath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> header </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><br></span></span> </div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/efcb8003-155a-46be-acdb-b7091d5f6894%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/efcb8003-155a-46be-acdb-b7091d5f6894%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390324353000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3G-jo8s4bUmwAFGPJSYaqt\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/efcb8003-155a-46be-acdb-b7091d5f6894%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390324353000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nbfw11YDOmpBpr3WoqPDn\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
